  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Big_Lost_City/MP_BigLostCity_header.webp\" width=\"2133\" height=\"686\"></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">大型失落之城是一款新的结构模组，部分灵感来源于《失落之城》，但在此模组中，这些结构将默认在世界中生成。当然，所有结构都是从零开始创建的，并且该模组与任何其他结构模组完全兼容。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Big_Lost_City/MP_BigLostCity_description.webp\" width=\"2133\" height=\"175\"></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">我们创建这个模组的目的是希望它能被添加到任何末世题材的整合包中。正如您将在下面的视频中看到的，它添加了各种现代建筑，但都因时间流逝而完全废弃。<br></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">部分建筑的灵感来源于地图制作者 tsunami 制作的地图。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/-Xh736Ry5oQ?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\" style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\"></iframe></span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Big_Lost_City/MP_BigLostCity_screenshots.webp\" width=\"2133\" height=\"175\"></span></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1556/90/big-lost-city-1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"2133\" height=\"1200\"></p><p>&nbsp;<br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1556/103/big-lost-city-3.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"2133\" height=\"1200\"></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1556/114/big-lost-city-6.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"2133\" height=\"1200\"></p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>准备好与朋友在最佳服务器上畅玩了吗？</strong></span><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><br></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fflashh\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Big_Lost_City/MP_BigLostCity_promo.webp\" width=\"2133\" height=\"267\"></strong></a></span></p><p><span st